htly vary from the accuracy we achieve in Kaggle submission. Totally 3 diverse types of neural network operations are tried on this dataset i.e. 1) Single Hidden MLP 2) RNN 3) DNN each Neural Net is processed in different ipynb files before combining it. DNN is my baseline model because I achieved my maximum accuracy of 88.53% while processing data with it and rank achieved in it is 1335 out of 9,803.","topics":[],"score":237536,"global_rank":85491},{"name":"shik3519/deep-learning","owner":"shik3519","html_url":"https://github.com/shik3519/deep-learning","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":["cnn-model","dataloader","pytorch"],"score":237532,"global_rank":85497},{"name":"Skymore/Track2COCO","owner":"Skymore","html_url":"https://github.com/Skymore/Track2COCO","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237530,"global_rank":85511},{"name":"joshspicer/pawprints-2019","owner":"joshspicer","html_url":"https://github.com/joshspicer/pawprints-2019","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"10 minute snapshots of (First Place!) Husky Hunt 2019 Team (Locations & Clues Solved)","topics":["huskyhunt","northeastern","pawprints"],"score":237515,"global_rank":85558},{"name":"shiwang0211/nlp_practice","owner":"shiwang0211","html_url":"https://github.com/shiwang0211/nlp_practice","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Practice for NLP-related concepts and models","topics":[],"score":237512,"global_rank":85564},{"name":"Es7evam/Knapsack-AI","owner":"Es7evam","html_url":"https://github.com/Es7evam/Knapsack-AI","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Implementation of Blind Searches and Heuristics at Knapsack problem","topics":["ai","best-fit","blind-search","branch-and-bound","knapsack"],"score":237510,"globa